### A. Install the core package

From the project root, using the repository's selected package manager:

```bash
# Set this to the approved compatible version before running.
DATADOG_RN_VERSION='REPLACE_WITH_APPROVED_VERSION'
yarn add --exact "@datadog/mobile-react-native@$DATADOG_RN_VERSION"

